# PokeBlog core

- Open repo root `PokeBlog/`. Packages live in `packages/*`.
- Required EmDash plugins (must stay registered in `astro.config.mjs`):
  - `@poke-emdash/plugin-theme-settings`
  - `@poke-emdash/plugin-pokemon-tcg` (id `pokemon-tcg`)
  - `@poke-emdash/plugin-scene-builder` (id `scene-builder`)
- Identifiers, files, slugs, routes: **English**. UI copy may be Spanish.
- Do not replace the Phaser scene home with a normal blog grid unless explicitly asked.
- Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/ASSETS.md` before structural changes.
